  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southern Kordofan Agriculture development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i)  To support the Government&apos;s strategy for the development of rainfed agriculture in order to increase food and livestock productivity which in turn improve the living standards of small-holder farmers and livestock owners in South and West Kordofan; and (ii) improve water supply sources in rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
